{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/X3IdQ1XirRno3GYIreP6WA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:29.575738+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/X3IdQ1XirRno3GYIreP6WA","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgLmPNTfwokAMQCcPeVIkWMFw9LL8ic5CjSdzry8QxM0wX9oNprt1iaLnliaSoTJo05P6hasC8COVgYwBjlbAMKAW4Il9CtPRpdL2o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgJ0g64jVAQhAEt2Vlf2epibSVRUledFC0iaYDTuiaqZAjIQlReFD95ibaYicrcQBJh5BE2dS8KlKIxw6ujuqX2cOrEibQBXcSvxQKmf8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgJVbaQNicWQ6QEH7E8xMR4l1WvcY90t41UsTozPHu1e3EwNy8NoRxshpvYvyM7T7ibibOoGvSzECibx39nF895DzfbLiaicKeu3M5Xlc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>武汉大学社会学院具有悠久的学科历史，是上世纪八十年代率先恢复社会学教学、重建社会学专业的全国10所高校之一。我院现有三个社会学学术学位硕士点（社会学、人类学、民俗学）、一个专业学位硕士点（社会工作）、一个社会学一级学科博士点、一个社会学博士后流动站和五个研究平台。学院现有专任教师30人，其中教授13人、副教授12人、讲师5人。</span></span></p><p><span><span>武汉大学社会学院秉持“小而精”“小而强”的发展理念，坚持“学科、学派、智库”三位一体发展目标，致力于打造无限热爱学生和无限热爱学术的师资队伍。社会学院具有鲜明的学生培养风格，追求学风最好，连续多年学生入馆（图书馆）率为全校第一。社会学院将培养大批杰出学者作为优先目标，特别强调“精英化培养、学术化导向”。</span></span></p><p><span><span>武汉大学社会学院欢迎有志于学术研究的同学跨学科（包括但不限于政治学、公共管理、经济学、法学、历史学、新闻传播、农林经济管理等学科）参加推免预报名。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgIQbtHruib9DrmVFhRQamUQ7pNNib4Hw7Nu3HJYNlqBecFHeAjX0QXxWCRkyv7DHd7285M1dHW8u7G5EwXgQLTlYNuExoVOtQQzc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgLEBZibYqsnbTyDtUpuLVRjNibn3lefJAHYFGibEwBdibnyMRUS1KotQnX5C8ajGicBnYrPhCT5jT6TJdwH5bpd3OcgT0aLf7y8eBCA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>社会学院研究生招生工作领导小组负责学院推免预报名组织领导工作，制定推免预报名工作方案并组织实施。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgJ6Jnmu0ZdVEXOjPOn7Q6T0oL1ETS7w96hFUNiaPX1HNJhdYAzSTO66IHibd2cgq5x1xukribFZ6dTbjt4IS6PfAgBkAvBvTm1ExA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgLT89noQUQia3MbyZqxiajE9L5JyicAXffAEubl7INA7yIqXzOQCZ5ZdSXae6iclgSDRIIIx5l5atTiafQJOnccHtNC1nL5q6MkiaEPY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgLibNHyfafyuJJtqyBCicmyuOplBSBiaIdiaYicD85nGwVt3Fw8VPOaL5yfic41icRVZSybn1OW9pW3enHD5F6N43cn1aK6ZbBhvoPFNw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgJexJwoRXIUDfX7sHDiaQLib4THSfQiaHVm6bicBHOvrt1r2TIMGkOmuA3ohIwu4qo5RxDscPUcdXvO7exe5m3dibEzeAS94sLZRky4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgJodDo8fp9EfNcRmF4DMwgs6Xs9MhQqKCN5pDwru5FkUAW1ZeeOTtW6o0FtjEWolSPAdst3iaDyx0f678LUWzlSSSY1iaAnvs9icw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>报名时间：</span><span><strong><span>即日起至8月26日下午17:00</span></strong></span><span>，有意愿者登录“武汉大学研究生招生服务平台（http://yz.whu.edu.cn）”（以下简称“推免预报名系统”，请使用Google Chrome浏览器），根据系统要求进行注册报名并上传材料。每位申请人限申请我院一个专业。</span></p><p><span>我院将根据网上报名情况组织审核，</span><span><strong><span>预计9月初确定复试名单，同时公布线上复试时间</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>复试名单及线上复试时间将在学院官网上公布，确定参加推免预报名的人员需在</span><span><strong><span>48小时内</span></strong></span><span>进系统确认是否参加，确定参加者请实名加入</span><span><strong><span>“2027社会学院推免预报名QQ群”</span></strong></span><span>。 群号将在学院官网后续发布的复试名单公告中公布，请申请者密切关注学院官网。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgLufibHmGkvtUw3myXabm1MAGTqBsKpEe3fTo1y56DFT2Ow3bTY1o1NQ18QIdoUQDNUmc9wWlicBwuYWOOJ3SvAiahHGYfeJD428Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgLASwpIsdZAGNg3ciaYwu7XZhwZiaawKLuib3spCiaUX0ayibKCOoGLEJdAuNAX3YhXRPc2Rh6OOh44iaddDicBxm2ANt0BHtFfookG7U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（一）申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>学习成绩优异，本科前两年半或三年学习成绩在本专业年级排名居前30%；身心健康的考生均可申请。有志于从事学术研究，具有较强科研潜力，“双一流”建设高校及建设学科的优秀应届本科毕业生优先。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（二）需提交的申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><p><span>1.“武汉大学社会学院2027年推免预报名申请表”（以下简称“申请表”，附件1）；</span></p><p><span>2.“武汉大学社会学院2027年推免预报名个人陈述”（以下简称“个人陈述”，附件2）。撰写个人陈述时，请注意说明优先申请武汉大学社会学院的原因，研究生毕业后的职业规划。</span><span><strong><span>个人陈述很重要，请认真撰写！</span></strong></span></p><p><span>3.前两年半或三年学习成绩单。国家英语四、六级考试成绩或TOEFL/GRE/GMAT/IELTS成绩等体现外语水平的证明。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>特别说明：不需要提供各类获奖或发表论文的证明材料。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>特别提示：上传材料中加盖学校/学院公章，如暑假期间暂无法加盖学校/学院公章，可于开学后补交。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>补交PDF版扫描材料发至邮箱：00030669@whu.edu.cn。（邮件命名：2027推免预报名补盖公章材料＋名字）</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>补交盖章材料必须和系统上传材料内容完全相同，内容不一致者，直接取消报名资格。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>所有材料一经上传，不予受理修改、替换及重复上传申请，请大家认真核查全部内容无误后再提交。</span></span></strong></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>（三）材料审核及复试人员选拔</span></strong></p></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>审核和复试人员选拔工作由社会学院招生工作领导小组负责。我院对报名期限内提交报名材料的学生进行初审，对照条件进行评估，确定复试名单并报武汉大学研究生院审核。经研究生院审核通过的复试名单将在社会学院官网公布。</span></p><p><span>入选复试名单的人员须在复试名单公布之日起</span><strong><span>48小时内</span></strong><span>通过报名系统确认是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃参加复试。不在复试名单内的为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgKeblMHiaicKEytIW67RCZtGUfqcMVibV2X794az1XoO8ZEuLJx4zcreniakUcjotbWQpjchgNE7Ch4GicQuib1d1kvH4DJibf4BpqUww/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgJ8QShe3w67QAQzxYZU8pzqtRxvatT7H6qDv7M0nh0eBw4lWL6fCo1eZiakVh2hiaiavvgxVxdVSicOnWagamNx9VB1ic7RFvXS2a2w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学院将按社会学一级学科开展复试选拔考核工作。复试选拔考核分为三个部分进行，即：背景评估、笔试及综合面试（含心理测试，凡心理素质测试不合格者，不能入选），三项满分各为100分。考核成绩计算公式为：复试选拔考核综合成绩＝背景评估×40%＋笔试成绩×20%＋综合面试×40%。根据复试选拔考核综合成绩排名情况，遴选出本次推免预报名复试通过人员名单。</span></p><p><span>凡取得“推免资格”的推免预报名复试通过人员，在规定时间内进入教育部推免系统申请武汉大学社会学院推免生，且服从调剂，可优先接收为我院2027级推免生。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgK2mtbvfaGlJuBlfM7O6R2tw11Gf5JMh3ib5rCbyZ7W1Vnb3ZRa8Bg5932GpyMEibRiaWIwgqBIbLfEObdoxOkKsYK8vopicDcxogU/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgJk4QKTvObZJOZywSfPntRiaMTRECtwdBFKrSibCGQZ8ic5yB7MNPlTUdq8eOIicwkphic2oaLV1LiahdgQjVOQ1BZ1ExwmXGXz8Ocbo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>本次通过遴选的复试人员名单经上报学校研招办审核同意后在学院官网公示，公示期不少于7天。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>社会学院</span></p><p><span>2026年8月4日</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/X3IdQ1XirRno3GYIreP6WA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：武汉大学社会学院2027年推免预报名申请表</a></span></section><section><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/X3IdQ1XirRno3GYIreP6WA\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：武汉大学社会学院2027年推免预报名个人陈述</a></span></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/kJ9uMbXFqgISTReQR0JSWs04PJVPBkJ0lzM1I7jwMCW79wnpPgdd2KTDbuWX7sB6E7rgYAQwMnVN9d6UFXXHx9aeVogiawlkESiaP50ZKE5hY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>排版 | 宋清玲</span></p><p><span>审核 | 孔敬伟</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/kJ9uMbXFqgJZ0BXBjulKrkzgFFTVNJq0cXuJmvUqsa4Fd1vZxHpvm71aV73IYricNv9VW3Tot6u3mhD6WIg0UvE8KtCARdLlaktlia6SibgyME/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b50d854015ac3700f39232ffd8de2ac7ecf3ee5b0bf91451e7990bfd5d36c6ec","textLength":1800,"sourceSha256":"a4dc03c81b201b9f462ee0e67a8b774d4e15a1a3d28392c2dabc2f3432f51127","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4be00cf3e6b3700f785e","title":"2026年武汉大学社会学院2027年推免生接收预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:29.575738+00:00"}
